# Code layers

> Repository 分层（≠ 认知层）。**文档 + oxlint `freeanima/layer-deps` + tsconfig paths**。目录地图 / 包名 → [`repository-topology.mdc`](repository-topology.mdc)。

## Habitat 栈（高 → 低）

```
portal/cli → platform → capabilities → engine → core → kernel
```

| Layer | Directory | Responsibility |
| ----- | --------- | -------------- |
| kernel | `packages/habitat/kernel/` | HookRegistry、logging、**config-mechanism**、**loop-mechanism**（P5 自 engine 迁入） |
| core | `packages/habitat/core/` | PG、Redis、产品 config 段、tool/LLM 原语 |
| engine | `packages/habitat/engine/` | conversation、turn、goal、pipeline；`loop/` 仅薄 re-export |
| capabilities | `packages/habitat/capabilities/` | self、memory、tools、outpost、mcp-*、… |
| platform | `packages/habitat/platform/` | 组合根；`service/` = AppRuntime |

并列：`packages/shared`、`packages/frontend/{ui-kit,client}`、features（按子树分属两包）、portal（按 form 分属两包）。

## Client 消环

```
app-frame → features/*/ui → { ui-kit, portal-sdk } → shared
```

- Feature UI **禁止** import app-frame / platform / engine / capabilities / `features/*/domain`
- Typed Habitat client：`@freeanima/client/portal-sdk/habitat-typed-client`
- Display/snapshot：`@freeanima/shared/rpc-contract/frames/{display,snapshot}`

## Dependency matrix

| Source | Allowed | Forbidden |
| ------ | ------- | --------- |
| `habitat/kernel`（除 loop-mechanism） | kernel、shared | 其它 habitat、features、client、ui-kit |
| `habitat/kernel/loop-mechanism` | kernel、shared、core 适配（过渡） | client、ui-kit、features UI |
| `habitat/core` | kernel, core | engine+ |
| `habitat/engine` | kernel, core, engine | platform, capabilities |
| `habitat/capabilities/*` | kernel, core, own pack, shared | platform, features, other capabilities*, engine |
| `habitat/platform` | 全 habitat + features 服务端 | ui-kit / client（除 habitat client 过渡） |
| `features/*/ui` | ui-kit, portal-sdk, shared | platform, engine, capabilities, app-frame, domain, drizzle |
| `ui-kit` | shared util（极少） | features, habitat, client |
| `shared` | shared | habitat、ui-kit、client、React |

**方向：** `omitUndefined` / CST 工具 SSOT 在 `@freeanima/shared/util`；存储形状吃 `@freeanima/shared/pg-shapes`。三分包依赖禁令 → `just qa check-package-deps`。

**CI**：`just qa check` → oxlint `layer-deps` + `check-frontend-no-drizzle` + `check-shared-shapes` + `check-package-deps`。

## Port / Catalog

Boot：`packages/habitat/platform/boot/`；入口：`serve.ts`。Capabilities 访问 PG：`@freeanima/habitat/core/db/pg/*`。
